  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0f9f62ca-2f9d-4a2f-a957-720ecd338fef-9888679.PNG\" style=\"width: 310px; height: 134px;\" /></p><p>At maximum height, only horizontal velocity of the particle remains. Let the angle of project be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math>. The horizontal velocity of the particle will remain same, therefore</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>u</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p>Now, time of flight of projectile is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>u</mi><mi>g</mi></mfrac></math></p>",
